### TicketFlash API — coleção de requisições
### Use com a extensão "REST Client" do VS Code (ou importe no Insomnia/Postman).
### Execute na ordem: as requisições com "# @name" guardam ids usados nas seguintes.

@api = http://localhost:8000

### Status da API, MongoDB e Redis
GET {{api}}/

############################################################
### EVENTOS — CRUD (Req. 2)
############################################################

### Listar todos os eventos
# @name eventos
GET {{api}}/eventos

@eventoId = {{eventos.response.body.$[0].id}}

### Listar com filtro por categoria
GET {{api}}/eventos?categoria=show

### Listar com filtro por categoria e cidade
GET {{api}}/eventos?categoria=show&cidade=São Paulo

### Criar evento (campos extras são aceitos: documento flexível)
# @name novoEvento
POST {{api}}/eventos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Jazz ao Entardecer",
  "categoria": "show",
  "data": "2027-04-10T19:00:00",
  "local": { "cidade": "Recife", "endereco": "Rua da Aurora, 100" },
  "atracoes": ["Quarteto Maré Alta", "Sax Nordeste"],
  "setores": [
    { "nome": "Pista", "preco": 90, "capacidade": 200 },
    { "nome": "Mesa", "preco": 250, "capacidade": 40 }
  ],
  "classificacaoEtaria": 12
}

@novoEventoId = {{novoEvento.response.body.id}}

### Buscar por id — 1ª chamada: "origem": "banco" (Req. 5)
GET {{api}}/eventos/{{eventoId}}

### Buscar por id — 2ª chamada: "origem": "cache"
GET {{api}}/eventos/{{eventoId}}

### Atualizar evento — apaga evento:{id} do Redis (Req. 9)
PUT {{api}}/eventos/{{eventoId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Evento Atualizado — Sessão Extra"
}

### Buscar de novo: volta a ser "origem": "banco"
GET {{api}}/eventos/{{eventoId}}

### Remover evento — também apaga o cache (Req. 9)
DELETE {{api}}/eventos/{{novoEventoId}}

### Buscar evento removido → 404
GET {{api}}/eventos/{{novoEventoId}}

############################################################
### RANKING (Req. 7)
############################################################

### Top 5 eventos mais vistos (Sorted Set)
GET {{api}}/eventos/ranking

############################################################
### FLUXO DE COMPRA (Req. 6, 8 e 10)
############################################################

### Listar usuários (para pegar um usuarioId)
# @name usuarios
GET {{api}}/usuarios

@usuarioId = {{usuarios.response.body.$[0].id}}
@setor = {{eventos.response.body.$[0].setores[0].nome}}

### Criar reserva (SET NX EX 600) — repita 11x em 1 minuto para ver o 429
# @name reserva
POST {{api}}/reservas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuarioId": "{{usuarioId}}",
  "eventoId": "{{eventoId}}",
  "setor": "{{setor}}",
  "quantidade": 2
}

@reservaId = {{reserva.response.body.reservaId}}

### Confirmar pedido (grava no MongoDB, $inc em vendidos, apaga reserva, publica no Pub/Sub)
POST {{api}}/pedidos/confirmar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reservaId": "{{reservaId}}"
}

### Confirmar a mesma reserva de novo → 410 Gone
POST {{api}}/pedidos/confirmar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reservaId": "{{reservaId}}"
}

### Confirmar reserva inexistente/expirada → 410 Gone
POST {{api}}/pedidos/confirmar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reservaId": "reserva-que-ja-expirou"
}

### Pedidos de um usuário (usa o índice pedidos.usuarioId)
GET {{api}}/pedidos?usuarioId={{usuarioId}}

############################################################
### RELATÓRIOS — Aggregation Pipeline (Req. 4)
############################################################

### Faturamento por evento ($match, $group, $lookup, $unwind, $project, $sort)
GET {{api}}/relatorios/faturamento

### Ocupação por setor de um evento ($match, $unwind, $project, $sort)
GET {{api}}/relatorios/ocupacao/{{eventoId}}
